GOAL{Identify risks in multi-agent system using compressed symbolic communication}
CTX{Agents exchange compressed symbols; compression may cause information loss or ambiguity}
PROBLEM{Compressed symbols may lead to misinterpretation, data corruption, or emergent miscommunication between agents}
PLAN{1. Analyze symbol compression ratio vs. information fidelity. 2. Check for symbol collision or ambiguous mapping. 3. Evaluate agent decoding consistency. 4. Assess error propagation across communication chains}
